sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Person
    participant A as Authy
    box rgb(244,241,255) Browsy · host
    participant B as Browsy
    participant W as Wizy · inside
    end
    participant ID as P · Personal
    participant TR as L · Local
    participant SH as S · Social

    Note over P,SH: P · L · S facets — browsy hosts, Wizy merges
    P->>A: link identity factors
    A-->>B: device · Telegram · email proofs
    B->>ID: derive identity key and profile
    ID-->>B: Personal keypair · recovery ready
    P->>B: open browsy on flove.org
    B->>W: read the vault on demand
    W->>TR: compute Local trust on click
    TR-->>W: vouches · 3-hop chain score
    W-->>B: merged P + L + S view
    B-->>P: show Local trust result
    P->>B: choose to share outward
    B->>SH: prepare related-network share
    SH-->>P: Share with other related Networks
    Note over B,W: Wizy stays inside browsy — no second client
    alt missing auth factor
        A-->>P: prompt to add factor in Authy
    else factors linked
        B-->>P: P · Personal confirmed
    end
    Note over B,TR: Local trust computed locally, Central displays
